Before operating this boat, perform the checks in the following checklist. Always follow the inspection and maintenance procedures and schedules described in this owner's/operator's manual.  Pre-operation checks should be made each time the boat is used. These checks can be completed in a short time. It is worth the time spent to ensure safety and reliability.

